{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Add the package","level":3,"anchor":"Add-the-package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"type":"text","text":", at the release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose documentation you’re reading. In "},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"<version>\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links a binary framework, "},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which SwiftPM checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Register the wallet","anchor":"Register-the-wallet","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleURLTypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for credentials, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","text":"Provide the keys and the storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key — the one a credential copy is bound to — signs when presenting, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Credential Request’s proof when receiving or refreshing. By default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode each time: add an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" describes the trade-off."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The app and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension then share one store: a store of your own implements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" atomically"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"across both processes, as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does with a file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lock."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","level":3,"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"URLError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network"},{"type":"text","text":" error; any other is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Create the wallet","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Create-the-wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle of leaves its keys behind. Each trust role whose roots you set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"needs a revocation choice: checked against the CRLs your app fetches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), or declined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"); see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, crls: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots,","            crls: crls,","            revocation: [.issuer, .status, .verifier])","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","level":3,"text":"Ship the release build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app must never have; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild"},{"type":"text","text":" says which one an app has,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Next-steps","level":3,"text":"Next steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","isActive":true}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting started"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"title":"holderAccessGroup","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every key is in the default group."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderAccessGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Presenting from a link"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","abstract":[{"text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential store and Wallet Provider.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"Wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletConfiguration"}],"title":"WalletConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"NewWallet’s configuration."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletConfiguration"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"WalletProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store (the Secure Enclave). ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the standard one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a ","type":"text"},{"code":".platform","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" WalletError.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"title":"KeyStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/noRevocationCheck":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The trust roles that decline checking revocation, as an explicit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"choice: only where something else stands in for it, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates too short-lived to be worth revoking. A role can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in both this and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noRevocationCheck"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationRole","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV14RevocationRoleO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"title":"noRevocationCheck","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/norevocationcheck","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform’s data protection. "},{"code":"FileCredentialStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"CredentialStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"text":"A store in the app group ","type":"text"},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its extensions listing the group in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.security.application-groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement share.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inAppGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Options","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/revocation":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"revocation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationRole","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV